      to survive one additional standard enemy hit.\r\n\r\nTier 2 \u2014 Upgrade
      \xB7 5,000\r\nIncreases maximum health further, reaching a second additional-hit
      threshold.\r\n\r\nTier 3 \u2014 Upgrade \xB7 7,500\r\n- Improves passive health
      regeneration.\r\n- Regeneration still respects the delay caused by Blood Reload."
    modelPrefab: {fileID: 358059130468457090, guid: 0b34ef6ebc6649e4dbea5422f7daf4e4, type: 3}
  - title: Six Pack
    description: This one makes you gay
